      "id": "S-solution",
      "text": "a=6+4exp[-(1 h^-1)t]、b=6-4exp[-(1 h^-1)t]，总量12 U，两室指数趋于6 U/L。",
      "type": "formal",
      "scope": "等恒定体积1L、k=0.5h^-1、初值(10,2)、无源损失、t>=0。",
      "work_status": "reviewed",
